---
layout: layouts/piece.njk
title: "The Café — Daily Special Story (1080 × 1920)"
canvasW: "1080px"
canvasH: "1920px"
pageCss: "/assets/css/fb-story-special.css"

# One Story per daily-special photo in src/_data/photos.json (special: true),
# through src/_data/specialPhotos.js. Same words as that photo's feed post.
pagination:
  data: specialPhotos
  size: 1
  alias: photo
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "/studio/fb-story-{{ photo.file | replace('/assets/photos/', '') | replace('.jpg', '') }}.html"

tags: studio
studioCategory: "Social"
studioSize: "1080 × 1920 px · Facebook Story"
studioNote: "The day's special as a Facebook Story, from its photo in src/_data/photos.json. Facebook lays its profile bar over the top of a Story and the reply box over the bottom, so nothing that matters sits in the top 230px or the bottom 220px. No price, like every special post; 'Drink included' shows when the photo sets includesDrink. Post it on the day it's served: it says Today's Special."
studioW: 1080
studioH: 1920
studioOrder: 31
---
{#- Top to bottom: the wordmark under Facebook's profile bar, the dish
    name, the photo full width, then what comes with it. The photo is
    square; it is cropped to 1080 × 820 from the centre, which loses
    counter above and below the plate, not food. -#}
<div class="canvas story">

    <div class="wordmark wordmark--light wordmark--hero story-wordmark">
        {% inlineSvg "/assets/thecafe.svg", "", site.name %}
    </div>

    <header class="story-head">
        <p class="p-label story-kicker">Today&rsquo;s Special</p>
        <h1 class="story-title">{{ photo.title }}</h1>
    </header>

    <img class="story-photo" src="{{ photo.file }}" alt="{{ photo.alt }}">

    <footer class="story-band">
        <p class="p-body story-desc">{{ photo.description }}</p>
        {%- if photo.includesDrink %}
        <p class="story-drink">Drink included</p>
        {%- endif %}
        <p class="p-body story-call">From 11am &middot; {{ site.social.website }}/menu</p>
    </footer>

</div>
